  "name": "luh-tensile-tests-of-dowsil-ei-1184",
  "notes": "Tensile tests on the silicone DOWSIL EI-1184 were performed according to DIN 53504 (based on ISO 37).\r\nThis included setting the testing machine (ZwickRoell Z0.5) velocity to 200 mm min-^1.\r\nThe silicone samples had the dog-bone shape S2 and were manufactured with a mixing ration of 1:1. They were manufactured, stored and tested at room temperature.\r\n\r\nThe provided dataset contains the results of each of the seven samples that were tested. Each file comprises of two columns, whereas the first column is the strain of the sample and the second the respective retraction force.\r\n\r\nThis research data was published under https://doi.org/10.1364/AO.499811",
